 <string name="ui_117" formatted="false">"Live translation guide"</string>
 <string name="ui_118" formatted="false">"1. Prepare the translation model. In Listen mode, download the English speech model once.\n\n2. Camera: frame the subtitles only. Listen: let the microphone hear English audio from another device.\n\n3. Fast mode uses short pauses and shorter segments. Choose Balanced or Full sentence for more context.\n\n4. Partial translations can change. Only completed phrases are spoken. Headphones reduce feedback.\n\n5. Assign a real TTS voice and style to each speaker profile. Select speakers manually in Listen mode.\n\n6. Stop or moving the app to the background turns off the microphone. With downloaded models and local TTS, internet is not required."</string>
